  "body": "Motivated Vendor - ALL OFFERS WILL BE CONSIDERED!!!\r\n\r\nStandalone, weatherboard and just a short walk from Browns Bay, this is an increasingly hard-to-find opportunity to secure your own home, land and outdoor space this close to the coast.\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned in a peaceful setting, the home is comfortable, vacant and ready to enjoy from day one.\r\n\r\nSunny open-plan living connects naturally with wraparound decking and a generous backyard, creating the kind of indoor-outdoor lifestyle that makes this property stand apart. There's room for summer entertaining, kids and pets, gardens, or simply having a genuine piece of outdoor space to call your own.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the internal garage, workshop, carport and additional off-street parking that offer a level of storage and practicality that's increasingly difficult to find. \r\n\r\nAnd while there's absolutely nothing stopping you from moving straight in and enjoying it as it stands, the property also gives you the freedom to personalise and enhance over time. A larger deck, landscaping or your own outdoor retreat, the opportunity is there for you to capitalise.\r\n\r\nFEATURES YOU'LL LOVE:\r\n\r\n- Walk to Browns Bay Beach and Shops\r\n- Standalone weatherboard home\r\n- Private & tranquil position\r\n- Generous backyard and outdoor living\r\n- Sunny open-plan kitchen, dining & living\r\n- Wraparound decking\r\n- Three generous bedrooms\r\n- Separate bathroom, toilet & laundry\r\n- Internal garage with workshop space\r\n- Carport plus additional off-street parking for all the toys\r\n- Zoned for Browns Bay & Torbay School, Northcross Intermediate & Long Bay College\r\n\r\nWalk to Browns Bay Village and the beach, enjoy everything the home offers today, and make it your own for the years ahead.\r\n\r\nThe property is vacant and the sellers are ready to move forward.\r\n\r\nWelcome home.",
